      "statement": "In non-sandboxed renderers ElectronRendererClient makes Blink defer the document load until preload scripts finish, saves Blink's fetch/Request/Response/Headers/FormData/EventSource as blink* globals because Node deletes them, and only the first Node environment becomes the libuv-driving uv env.",
